# Simple cube test file with vertex positions (v), normals (vn), and faces (f)

# Vertex positions (X, Y, Z)
v -0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5  0.5  0.5
v -0.5  0.5  0.5
v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5  0.5 -0.5

# Vertex normals (X, Y, Z)
vn  0.0  0.0  1.0
vn  0.0  0.0 -1.0
vn  0.0  1.0  0.0
vn  0.0 -1.0  0.0
vn  1.0  0.0  0.0
vn -1.0  0.0  0.0

# Faces referencing vertex/normal indices (vertex/texture/normal)
# Format: f v1/vt1/vn1 v2/vt2/vn2 v3/vt3/vn3 (or f v//vn v//vn v//vn)
f 1//1 2//1 3//1
f 1//1 3//1 4//1
f 5//2 8//2 7//2
f 5//2 7//2 6//2
f 4//3 3//3 7//3
f 4//3 7//3 8//3
f 1//4 5//4 6//4
f 1//4 6//4 2//4
f 2//5 6//5 7//5
f 2//5 7//5 3//5
f 1//6 4//6 8//6
f 1//6 8//6 5//6